00:18:09,330 --> 00:18:12,090
The rewards in the training curve look great.

202
00:18:12,558 --> 00:18:16,550
You take the final checkpoint and you start playing around with it, and it makes no sense.

203
00:18:17,070 --> 00:18:25,470
It's either thinking for way too long or is just like keeps on writing as someone who in real profession would never write.

204
00:18:25,998 --> 00:18:31,470
So as a result, when we look at the data, we are very concerned about its ability to actually train the model.

205
00:18:32,150 --> 00:18:37,970
And how do we close that gap between the data is high quality and understandable, but can it train the model?

206
00:18:38,574 --> 00:18:42,270
