I lead the safety and alignment business for Handshake, which is essentially, it's more of a services portfolio than post-training data sales.

1209
01:55:07,982 --> 01:55:14,980
We operate as like a diagnostic partner to Frontier Labs to help them understand the risks that might come from a new model release.

1210
01:55:15,918 --> 01:55:17,760
