02:01:29,920 --> 02:01:31,320
Failures here are very serious.

1277
02:01:31,918 --> 02:01:40,080
The one qualification that I would make, though, is that these are not only looking for sort of end states, they're looking for intercepting risk at the earliest stages.

1278
02:01:40,814 --> 02:01:50,520
So it's not it's not the final series of interactions or of the content generation, it's how effectively are models sort of diverting away from harmful topics at the start.

