02:02:00,400 --> 02:02:05,316
And so these behaviors change very significantly in matters of weeks and months.

1281
02:02:05,400 --> 02:02:10,340
It's not necessarily like a long-term trajectory that we're observing.

1282
02:02:11,054 --> 02:02:16,160
I think for people that are interested in the topic, Your paper has a nice breakdown of other categories.

1283
02:02:16,526 --> 02:02:21,380
It's a great thing to just familiarize yourself with.

1284
02:02:21,820 --> 02:02:27,620
So, you know, mental illness, therapy, scams, malware, deception.

1285
02:02:28,174 --> 02:02:31,720
These are just terms that you should have an understanding of.

1286
02:02:32,240 --> 02:02:35,800
I think we can, you know, leave it there for people that want to check out more.

1287
02:02:35,900 --> 02:02:36,480
There is a paper.

1288
02:02:36,620 --> 02:02:37,420
There's a data set.

1289
02:02:37,940 --> 02:02:38,620
You're right.

1290
02:02:38,680 --> 02:02:39,700
The jumps are pretty crazy.

